\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"add_border_radius_50 remove_border community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/512264?s_tid=mlc_recom_user\">Stuart McGarrity<\/a> in <a href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/videos?s_tid=mlc_recom_appindex\"> Blogs<\/a> on 03 September 2026\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post_body\">Here I try and debug a problem in a MATLAB Web App that was reported by one of my colleagues. I try and do a rather simple fix. See if you can determine why this attempt will not work. Features covered in this code-along style video include:  save try, catch  Play the video in full screen mode for<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tag_list remove_margin_10 add_margin_10\"><span class=\"tag-label\">Categories: <\/span><ul class=\"list-unstyled list-inline add_display_inline\"><li><a href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/videos\/category\/app-designer\/?&s_tid=mlc_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">App Designer<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/videos\/category\/code-along\/?&s_tid=mlc_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">Code-Along<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/videos\/category\/video\/?&s_tid=mlc_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">Format: Video<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/videos\/category\/web-apps-app-designer\/?&s_tid=mlc_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web Apps<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-3 text-center add_vertical_align_middle img_wrapper add_margin_10_xs\"><img class=\"preview_img pull-left pull_right_lg pull_right_md pull_right_sm\" src=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/videos\/files\/Snag_3492a8f.png\" alt=\"Thumbnail\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"meta-data col-xs-12\"><ul class=\"list-unstyled list-inline add_display_inline small mb-0\"><li class=\"list-inline-item add_indent_10\"><span class=\"icon-watch icon_16\"><\/span>   235<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item add_indent_10\"><span class=\"icon-feedback icon_16\"><\/span> 0<\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"panel panel-default home-content-card recommendation_card\">\n\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"add_font_arial\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"card-title\" href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/simulink\/2026\/08\/06\/building-and-controlling-a-gantry-crane-with-simulink-simscape-multibody-and-codex\/?s_tid=mlc_recom_leaf\">Building and Controlling a Gantry Crane with Simulink, Simscape Multibody, and Codex<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-9 remove_margin_5 add_text_wrapping\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post_meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"author_inline\" data-locale-id=\"en\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mathworks.com\/matlabcentral\/profile\/authors\/1248313\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"add_border_radius_50 remove_border community_profile_image\" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/1248313?s_tid=mlc_recom_user\">Guy Rouleau<\/a> in <a href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/simulink?s_tid=mlc_recom_appindex\"> Blogs<\/a> on 06 August 2026\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post_body\">A few days ago, my colleague Ned Gulley published this blog post: Simulate in MATLAB, Animate in Blender.Ned simulated a sliding gantry crane supporting a heavy swinging load and then controlled it to swing the load above a wall. Here is what the final result looks like:In his post, Ned did not incl...<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tag_list remove_margin_10 add_margin_10\"><span class=\"tag-label\">Categories: <\/span><ul class=\"list-unstyled list-inline add_display_inline\"><li><a href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/simulink\/category\/ai-coding-assistant\/?&s_tid=mlc_lp_tag\" rel=\"nofollow\">AI Coding Assistant<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/blogs.math