" src=\"\/responsive_image\/75\/75\/0\/0\/0\/profile\/4622813?s_tid=mlc_recom_user\">MathWorks Support Team<\/a> in <a href=\"\/matlabcentral\/answers\/index?s_tid=mlc_recom_appindex\"> MATLAB Answers<\/a> on 06 March 2013\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post_body\">How do I add or remove an end user on my License? kA0i00000007kypCAA 000004337<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-3 text-center add_vertical_align_middle add_margin_10_xs mb-2\"><div class=\"community_panel panel panel-default add_margin_0 add_border_color_green add_font_color_green replies-box pull-left pull_right_lg pull_right_md pull_right_sm\"><div class=\"panel-body\"><p class=\"answers-count\">1<\/p><p class=\"answers-count-label\">answer<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"meta-data col-xs-12\"><ul class=\"list-unstyled list-inline add_display_inline small mb-0\"><li class=\"list-inline-item\"><span class=\"icon-like icon_16\"><\/span>   2<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item add_indent_10\"><span class=\"icon-watch icon_16\"><\/span>   494<\/li><li class=\"list-inline-item add_indent_10\"><span class=\"icon-feedback icon_16\"><\/span> 0<\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"panel panel-default home-content-card recommendation_card\">\n\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"add_font_arial\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"card-title\" href=\"https:\/\/blogs.mathworks.com\/digitaleng\/2026\/07\/09\/from-models-to-binaries-where-the-software-bill-of-materials-fits-in-the-digital-thread\/?s_tid=mlc_recom_leaf\">From Models to Binaries: Where the Software Bill of Materials Fits in the Digital Thread<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-9 remove_margin_5 add_text_wrapping\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<sp